{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"getter","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":"="},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"setter"},{"kind":"text","text":"="},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setVolatile:"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"type":"text","text":", tiles of this source are neither written to nor read from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ambient cache on disk, whatever the response’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Cache-Control"},{"type":"text","text":" header says;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they are held in memory for as long as the map needs them. Use it for content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose terms forbid storing it, or that must not outlive the session. Other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources, such as a TileJSON file the source is configured with, are still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cached. The default is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set it before adding the source to a style, so that no tile is requested"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under the old setting."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/d